{"title": "Brace (Melee)", "pageid": 4174, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Brace_(Melee)", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Movement-expending actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Brace_(Ranged)\" title=\"Brace (Ranged)\">Brace (Ranged)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Brace_Melee.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Brace_Melee.webp/300px-Brace_Melee.webp, /w/images/f/fa/Brace_Melee.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Brace_Melee.webp/300px-Brace_Melee.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Brace_Melee.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Brace (Melee)</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a> available to characters <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">proficient</a> in and wielding a <a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\">glaive</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\">pike</a> in their main hand.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSpend 6 m (20 ft) of your <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">movement</a>. For the rest of your turn, roll melee damage twice and use the highest result.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 6 m (20 ft) <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Steady</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Steady\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Steady\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=IsDefaultWeaponAction_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"IsDefaultWeaponAction (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">IsDefaultWeaponAction</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Braced\"> Condition: Braced </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Braced_(Condition)\" title=\"Braced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Braced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Braced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Braced_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Braced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Braced_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Braced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Braced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Braced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Braced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Braced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Braced_(Condition)\" title=\"Braced (Condition)\">Braced</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>On damage rolls, roll twice and use the higher result.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by wielding the following weapon types with <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/38px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/50px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glaives\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\">Glaives</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/38px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/50px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pikes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\">Pikes</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The effect of Brace is equivalent the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Savage_Attacker\" title=\"Savage Attacker\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/20px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/30px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/40px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Savage Attacker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/20px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Savage_Attacker\" title=\"Savage Attacker\">Savage Attacker</a> feat and stacks with it. With both, each damage die is rolled 3 times and the highest value is taken.</li>\n<li>When used with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Savage_Attacker\" title=\"Savage Attacker\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/20px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/30px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/40px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Savage Attacker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp/20px-Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Savage_Attacker_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Savage_Attacker\" title=\"Savage Attacker\">Savage Attacker</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Great Weapon Fighting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1f/Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/40px-Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Fighting\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1f/Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1f/Great_Weapon_Fighting_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Great Weapon Fighting\">Great Weapon Fighting</a>, Brace will do a first roll and reroll if it is a 1 or 2, and then roll 2 more times and use the highest result. When used in this way, the effects of Savage Attacker and Great Weapon Fighting still function together, but with diminishing returns (<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Math\">see tables</a>).</li>\n<li>Brace breaks <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\">Hiding</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When combined with other dice rerolling features, the combat log may show an incorrect number of rerolls.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math\">Math</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Average_bonus_damage_of_Brace\">Average bonus damage of Brace</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Average bonus damage per die rolled\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Damage die</th>\n<th>Average bonus damage</th>\n<th>Average damage roll\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d4</td>\n<td>0.63</td>\n<td>3.13\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d6</td>\n<td>0.97</td>\n<td>4.47\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d8</td>\n<td>1.31</td>\n<td>5.81\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d10</td>\n<td>1.65</td>\n<td>7.15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d12</td>\n<td>1.99</td>\n<td>8.49\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2d6</td>\n<td>1.94</td>\n<td>8.94\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Average_bonus_damage_of_Brace_and_Savage_Attacker\">Average bonus damage of Brace and Savage Attacker</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Average bonus damage per die rolled\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Damage die</th>\n<th>Average bonus damage</th>\n<th>Average damage roll</th>\n<th>Avg bonus damage added by Savage Attacker (or Brace)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d4</td>\n<td>0.94</td>\n<td>3.44</td>\n<td>0.32\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d6</td>\n<td>1.46</td>\n<td>4.96</td>\n<td>0.49\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d8</td>\n<td>1.97</td>\n<td>6.47</td>\n<td>0.66\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d10</td>\n<td>2.47</td>\n<td>7.97</td>\n<td>0.82\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d12</td>\n<td>2.98</td>\n<td>9.48</td>\n<td>0.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2d6</td>\n<td>2.92</td>\n<td>9.92</td>\n<td>0.98\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Average_bonus_damage_of_Brace_and_Savage_Attacker_and_Great_Weapon_Fighting\">Average bonus damage of Brace and Savage Attacker and Great Weapon Fighting</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Average bonus damage per die rolled\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Damage die</th>\n<th>Average bonus damage</th>\n<th>Average damage roll</th>\n<th>Avg bonus damage added by Great Weapon Fighting</th>\n<th>Avg bonus damage added by Savage Attacker\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d4</td>\n<td>1.08</td>\n<td>3.58</td>\n<td>0.14</td>\n<td>0.21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d6</td>\n<td>1.62</td>\n<td>5.12</td>\n<td>0.16</td>\n<td>0.35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d8</td>\n<td>2.13</td>\n<td>6.63</td>\n<td>0.16</td>\n<td>0.51\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d10</td>\n<td>2.64</td>\n<td>8.14</td>\n<td>0.17</td>\n<td>0.67\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1d12</td>\n<td>3.14</td>\n<td>9.64</td>\n<td>0.16</td>\n<td>0.83\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2d6</td>\n<td>3.24</td>\n<td>10.24</td>\n<td>0.32</td>\n<td>0.70\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ebI3SACmQFpC82tSN5UOQEI4HwizHDOPZDofTJqh9Hs/edit#gid=781019269\">Savage Attacker and Great Weapon Fighting calculations</a> by Kalaeman</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041010\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.094 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3815/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41601/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16247/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1721236/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   76.593      1 -total\n 98.93%   75.773      1 Template:Feature_page\n 86.12%   65.961     41 Template:Trim\n 18.59%   14.237      9 Template:Icon_text\n 16.28%   12.472      8 Template:Icon_link\n 15.91%   12.188      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.42%   10.276      2 Template:SmCond\n 10.14%    7.764      1 Template:Condition\n  8.97%    6.873      3 Template:SmSAI\n  8.51%    6.521      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4174-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715041010 and revision id 379057. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}